{
  "id": "hold-reservations",
  "language": "rust",
  "kind": "existing",
  "split": "holdout",
  "title": "Atomic reservation batches",
  "trigger": "first_write",
  "requirements": [
    "data 含 stock 非负整数和 batches 二维非负整数数组。每批申请依次扣库存；有一项不足则整批回滚并输出 rejected，否则输出剩余库存。",
    "修复当前实现在拒绝批次后仍保留部分扣减的问题。"
  ],
  "correction": "拒绝后不再回滚整批，而是跳过不足的单项、继续批内其余项；每批始终输出剩余库存，不再输出 rejected。 调用者已更新 verify.py；不要修改该文件，保留其余要求和 NOTES.txt。",
  "notes": "Caller notes for hold-reservations: preserve this file byte for byte.\n",
  "checks": [
    {
      "id": "enough",
      "group": "core",
      "input": {
        "op": "solve",
        "data": {
          "stock": 10,
          "batches": [
            [
              2,
              3
            ],
            [
              1
            ]
          ]
        }
      },
      "expected": [
        5,
        4
      ],
      "public": true
    },
    {
      "id": "empty-batch",
      "group": "core",
      "input": {
        "op": "solve",
        "data": {
          "stock": 4,
          "batches": [
            []
          ]
        }
      },
      "expected": [
        4
      ],
      "public": false
    },
    {
      "id": "partial",
      "group": "correction",
      "input": {
        "op": "solve",
        "data": {
          "stock": 5,
          "batches": [
            [
              2,
              9,
              1
            ]
          ]
        }
      },
      "expected": [
        2
      ],
      "public": true,
      "before": [
        "rejected"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "continue",
      "group": "correction",
      "input": {
        "op": "solve",
        "data": {
          "stock": 5,
          "batches": [
            [
              2,
              8
            ],
            [
              3
            ]
          ]
        }
      },
      "expected": [
        3,
        0
      ],
      "public": false,
      "before": [
        "rejected",
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "empty",
      "group": "edge",
      "input": {
        "op": "solve",
        "data": {
          "stock": 0,
          "batches": []
        }
      },
      "expected": [],
      "public": false
    },
    {
      "id": "zero",
      "group": "edge",
      "input": {
        "op": "solve",
        "data": {
          "stock": 0,
          "batches": [
            [
              0
            ]
          ]
        }
      },
      "expected": [
        0
      ],
      "public": false
    }
  ]
}
